WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.985 --> 00:00:02.255
Chaityavandan Vidhi

00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:04.739
First, give one Khamsaman

00:00:09.026 --> 00:00:11.125
Then, stand and join your hands

00:00:11.125 --> 00:00:12.108
in the yoga mudra

00:00:12.319 --> 00:00:14.285
Say Iriyavahiyam, Tassa Uttari

00:00:14.285 --> 00:00:15.917
and Annatha Sutra

00:00:16.093 --> 00:00:17.513
Then, perform 1 Kausagga of 1 Logassa

00:00:17.513 --> 00:00:18.802
 or 4 Navkar Mantras.

00:00:22.448 --> 00:00:24.175
recite ‘Namo Arihantanam’ 

00:00:24.175 --> 00:00:25.542
After completing Kausagga,

00:00:25.542 --> 00:00:26.442
with join hands

00:00:26.442 --> 00:00:27.509
in the Yoga Mudra,

00:00:27.720 --> 00:00:29.188
chant the Logassa Sutra.

00:00:29.364 --> 00:00:31.154
Then give 3 Khamasamno.

00:00:35.771 --> 00:00:38.084
Icchakaren Sandhisahan Bhagwan,

00:00:38.084 --> 00:00:39.593
Chaityavandan Karu ?

00:00:39.593 --> 00:00:41.144
seek permission

00:00:41.522 --> 00:00:42.739
Then, sitting down

00:00:42.739 --> 00:00:45.953
fold the left knee up

00:00:46.147 --> 00:00:47.320
in the Yoga Mudra,

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:49.654
recite  Sakal - Kushal - Valli stuti

00:00:49.654 --> 00:00:51.324
Then recite the Chaityavandana

00:00:51.447 --> 00:00:54.478
If possible, recite Mulnayak Bhgwan 
 Chaityavandana

00:00:54.883 --> 00:00:58.144
then recite Jan Kin Chi Sutra and 
 Namuthunam Sutra 

00:00:58.487 --> 00:01:00.487
Then, with both hands joined at the 
 forehead, 

00:01:00.487 --> 00:01:02.197
bow in the Mukta Sukti Mudra 

00:01:02.197 --> 00:01:04.303
and recite the "Javanti Chheiyai Sutra."

00:01:04.303 --> 00:01:06.197
then give one Khamsaman

00:01:09.013 --> 00:01:11.013
with both hands joined at the 
 forehead, 

00:01:11.013 --> 00:01:12.388
bow in the Mukta Sukti Mudra 

00:01:12.388 --> 00:01:14.608
recite "Javant Kevi Sahu Sutra."

00:01:14.608 --> 00:01:16.326
then in Yoga Mudra

00:01:16.326 --> 00:01:18.000
Then recite the "Namorhat Sutra"

00:01:18.000 --> 00:01:18.748
recite Stavan

00:01:18.748 --> 00:01:20.792
or recite the Uvasaggaharam Sutra.

00:01:20.950 --> 00:01:22.756
 then both hands joined at the 
 forehead, 

00:01:22.756 --> 00:01:24.307
bow in the Mukta Sukti Mudra 

00:01:24.430 --> 00:01:25.870
Recite the "Jai Viray Sutra"

00:01:25.870 --> 00:01:27.565
up to the "Aabhavamakhanda."

00:01:27.855 --> 00:01:30.977
Then, with your hands lowered in the Yoga 
 Mudra,

00:01:31.127 --> 00:01:33.497
recite "Jai Viray" to the end.

00:01:33.497 --> 00:01:34.908
Afterward, stand up

00:01:34.908 --> 00:01:36.046
Then, stand up.

00:01:36.046 --> 00:01:37.157
in Yoga Mudra

00:01:37.157 --> 00:01:38.761
Recite the Arihanta Cheiyanam Sutra

00:01:38.761 --> 00:01:40.567
and the Annatha Sutra

00:01:40.567 --> 00:01:42.629
Then do the Kaussagg of one Navkar 

00:01:43.016 --> 00:01:44.805
recite "Namo Arihantaṇam"

00:01:44.805 --> 00:01:46.092
After crossing Kausagga,

00:01:46.092 --> 00:01:47.186
with join hands

00:01:47.186 --> 00:01:48.306
in the Yoga Mudra,

00:01:48.306 --> 00:01:50.306
recite 1 Stuti or Thoy

00:01:50.306 --> 00:01:52.051
Then give 1 Khamasamno

00:01:52.517 --> 00:01:55.766
say "Aviḍhi Asaṭhana Michchhami 
 Dukkadam,"

